# Secrets. The Containerfile copies config/ into the final image, so anything
# secret that lives there travels with every locally built image. Nothing in
# this repository holds a usable key any more (ADR 0021) — the example configs
# reference ${S3EP_AES_KEY} and the token is passed as S3EP_LICENSE_TOKEN at run
# time — and these rules keep it that way for a working tree that has generated
# its own.
config/license.jwt
.env
*.jwt
*.pem
*.key

